{"title":"2023 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The distance from point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/d/a8d0c6b840a12d05c098bfea7ef89c07993e469b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(x, y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"58\" height=\"20\" /> to the origin <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/0/7402ce2e0065c47203a152745703da0cb48793bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O(0, 0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"57\" height=\"20\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/6/b7616a230c77f0d9a577e5bca01aa06f1c35c457.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />.<br />\nThe distance from point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/d/a8d0c6b840a12d05c098bfea7ef89c07993e469b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(x, y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"58\" height=\"20\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/1/34152cb8ad13c7ca5874a68da50caa1ee478b519.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A(16, 0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"65\" height=\"20\" /> is also <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/6/b7616a230c77f0d9a577e5bca01aa06f1c35c457.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />.<br />\nWhat are the two possible pairs of coordinates <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/f/adfd9ae8a3fac031d3b8b470a52a709a23d4d6d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x, y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"44\" height=\"20\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using the distance formula for both points, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/1/8d170d3a4209ec952f5809b2ef28c755cbb8d317.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{(x - 0)^{2} + (y - 0)^{2}} = 17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"210\" height=\"35\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/2/cb2ba4c0d229e2b49e6bb11eac216c085366eb1e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{2} + y^{2} = 17^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"109\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/4/3647596a63678aec91c908b91acfd5322c2d981a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{(x - 16)^{2} + (y - 0)^{2}} = 17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"219\" height=\"35\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/f/fff92a75ffb804c86498357814d2d939921f377b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x - 16)^{2} + y^{2} = 17^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"163\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p>Equating both equations with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/f/1cfb79cc2ba71f37b77d3e7a2affe0b767153def.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$17^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"27\" height=\"17\" />, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/5/a35280153fe78a6290b73ebd8b1f239b5588951c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{2} + y^{2} = (x - 16)^{2} + y^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"195\" height=\"21\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/f/85fc7ddb570f627afb22f6a9094493cae4134daa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{2} = (x - 16)^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"116\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p>This means that either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/f/63f01494f106d2d675654fc122d604684cd11507.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = x - 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"87\" height=\"15\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/c/81c9e98036ba30b550451a40f2989ee5de3ed20b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-x = x - 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"101\" height=\"15\" />. The first equation isn't possible since it gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/4/f94e10ff1490d89bec0d201f25cdf1ec0d281fa4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 = -16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"67\" height=\"15\" />, but the other equation gives a valid solution:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/f/73f8e3cb7b1d812ab52b6f2fba6c93044e3c5679.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + x = 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"87\" height=\"15\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/6/846c9189863fc57ebe72628735f53b7bc64a58e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x = 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"64\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/9/839a315b56e10b2e680b4d90f3352f0e8d268908.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{16}{2} = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"92\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>Plugging this into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/2/cb2ba4c0d229e2b49e6bb11eac216c085366eb1e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{2} + y^{2} = 17^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"109\" height=\"20\" /> to find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/8/03830089d37461659a15e6818b9b5862c42f7e8f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8^{2} + y^{2} = 17^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"107\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/2/ed2c11096a713a7c2edcefe3c4f78d8a62f6dc2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y^{2} + 64 = 289$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"111\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/7/8375dc7bda777aa6251d4b202b66af49aaff58d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y^{2} = 289 - 54 = 225$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"162\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/f/81fc6471b45a23e73a4187389de871c32fb9f9f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = \\pm \\sqrt{225}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"92\" height=\"23\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/2/222e419e21b3af8b0d85a2f775ffdfa54155396d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = \\pm 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"65\" height=\"16\" />. This means that the possible coordinates for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/1/441bacd98318fe78e0011e0af7366a921b8f4fbd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(8, 15)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"63\" height=\"32\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/9/80918e523af21bd8fe579d757a33e8206e25e61f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(8, -15)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"77\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CSMC\" title=\"2023 CSMC\">2023 CSMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CSMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CSMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CSMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CSMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2\" title=\"2023 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 2\">Part A Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">Part A Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1\" title=\"2023 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 1\">Part A 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2\" title=\"2023 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 2\">Part A 2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Part A 3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">Part A 4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">Part A 5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">Part A 6</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 1 (page does not exist)\">Part B 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">Part B 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Part B 3</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Senior_Competition\" title=\"CEMC Senior Competition\">CEMC Senior Competition</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018064931\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.025 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.043 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 169/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1283/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 134/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5722/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.614      1 Template:CEMC_CIMC/CSMC_box\n100.00%    7.614      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37433:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018064931 and revision id 289346. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}